  m_text: This editor provides a flexible environment for generating and modifying
    models of the large intestine. Using its tools, the shape can be freely adjusted
    with the control nodes, allowing smooth changes in curvature and proportion.
    Shape presets can be applied and customized to quickly explore different configurations.
    Each section of the intestine can be refined in detail, with control over its
    anatomical features to match the level of accuracy you need. In addition, the
    editor allows diseases to be placed freely within the model, making it possible
    to represent different clinical cases.
